invariant: INV-14
file: srv_quic.c
catches: quic_loop_test
reason: ch_srv_quic_init reads no instant from the caller's clock, so the
  session's instant stays 0, and the QUIC server issues no ticket and
  accepts none. A full handshake still completes, so only resumption
  notices: the QUIC loop resumes the ticket the server issued, and
  objects.

--- old
    q->t.now_seconds = cfg_clock_read(cfg); // the instant every ticket rule reads
--- new
